    <ontology/quoteText/#resource> "TORTOISE-SHELL: (GER. and DU. Schildpad. DA. Skildpaddeskal. SW. Sköldpadda. FR. Ecaille de tortue. CRET. IT. Tartaruga. SP. Carey, Coucha. PORT. Fartaruga, Coucha. RUS. Kost tscherepachowaja. POL. Skorupa zolwia. LAT. Testudinis testa,) the shell of the testaceous animal called a tortoise; used in inlaying, and in various other works, as for snuff-boxes, co..."@en ;
